# Whitelist model: ignore everything at the root except the things that
# belong on `source`. New tools drop new artifacts (dist/, .cache/, coverage/)
# and this ignores them by default instead of requiring a new rule each time.
/*

!/.github/
!/brand-acme/
!/docs/
!/scripts/
!/shared

!/.gitignore
!/.gitmodules
!/README.md
!/SUBSCRIBERS.yml
!/fstab.yaml
!/package.json
!/package-lock.json

# macOS drops these inside every directory, including ones just un-ignored
# above - /* alone (root-only) would not catch them there.
**/.DS_Store
